sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Usuário
  participant W as Aplicação web
  participant AC as AuthController
  participant AS as AuthService
  participant R as UserRepository
  participant T as TokenService
  participant M as Resend (e-mail)
  U->>W: Preenche cadastro e aceita os termos
  W->>AC: POST /api/v1/auth/register
  AC->>AS: register(dados)
  AS->>R: existsByEmail(email)
  R-->>AS: false
  AS->>R: save(User com hash bcrypt)
  AS->>T: emailVerification(user)
  AS->>M: envia link de confirmação de e-mail
  AS->>T: access(user) (15 min) e refresh(user) (30 dias)
  AS-->>AC: Session
  AC-->>W: 201 Created
  W-->>U: Abre o feed inicial
  Note over U,W: Login: POST /auth/login valida e-mail e senha e devolve novos tokens.<br/>Falha retorna 401 com mensagem genérica.
